    "preamble": "Anshar Quraishi vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 24 July, 2025 Author: Manoj Kumar Gupta Bench: Manoj Kumar Gupta High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2025:Ahc:121888-Db Court No. - 21 Case :- Writ - C No. - 17489 of 2025 Petitioner :- Anshar Quraishi Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Mashaluddin Shah,Sarvesh Yadav",
    "facts": "The instant petition has been filed with grievance that the petitioner, who is having a valid license under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 for working as a whole-seller, distributor, retailer of meat, is not being permitted to carry on his business. The petitioner has accordingly prayed for a direction to the respondent to decide his representation filed in this behalf.",
